{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1456651-how-maxed-out-are-the-proxies","id":1456651,"title":"How Maxed Out Are The Proxies?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-12T06:18:59-07:00","id":1456651,"title":"How Maxed Out Are The Proxies?","content":"I was looking through the descriptions of Psi powers and I wondered if any of the Proxies had the seventh dot power for their aptitude. Those seventh dot powers can be pretty scary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26999-rhiannon-vashti","name":"Rhiannon Vashti","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26999_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-08-12T06:26:59-07:00","id":1456654,"title":"","content":"They all have access to the 7th dot power, some of them are described using it, Del Fuego have many clones, Bu Li currently can only communicate and interact using the telepathic projection, the Prexy possibly have his personal files in the subquantum space.<br /> <br /> I would add that Bhurano probably have many auxiliary modes at 2 dots, including VK and EK probably (my personal description of her as a Psiad being that she would have VK and EK as primary Aptitudes)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\